+To route the pinned pytest suites through verifyit, add `--verifyit-enabled`. The
+generated tasks include `tests/verifier.toml` and install the pinned verifier in
+the task image. Harbor then runs the unchanged protected pytest assertions and
+records a binary reward: every reported test must pass. The original task path
+remains the default. Pass `--overwrite` when switching an already fetched task
+to this route; existing task directories are otherwise skipped.
+
 If you omit `--task-ids`, `uv run compilebench` now defaults to fetching all tasks.
 
